"""judgements-run — deterministic plan/render/record over judgement declarations.

Thin shim over the dev_playbook.judgements.runner library: resolve the repo's [tool.judgements]
config, load and validate declarations, and run the requested subcommand. See
that module for the logic and its tests.
"""

